/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Current blood management relies heavily on manual processes, leading to delays in finding suitable blood donors or supplies, especially in emergencies. This system seeks to eliminate these inefficiencies by providing a centralized database for easy access to donor and blood availability information.)
