/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This project aims to develop a Blood Bank Management System that can be utilized by clinics, hospitals, laboratories, or during emergencies requiring blood units. The system facilitates the quick identification of the required blood types from both blood banks and donors, addressing the inefficiencies in current grapevine communication methods. The goal is to mitigate panic during emergencies by ensuring the timely availability of blood.)
/E (This project aims to develop a Blood Bank Management System that can be utilized by clinics, hospitals, laboratories, or during emergencies requiring blood units. The system facilitates the quick identification of the required blood types from both blood banks and donors, addressing the inefficiencies in current grapevine communication methods. The goal is to mitigate panic during emergencies by ensuring the timely availability of blood.)
